flowchart TD
    Redirect[Successful Redirect]
        --> Emit[Emit Redirect Event]

    Emit --> Buffer{Worker Buffer Available?}

    Buffer -->|Yes| Queue[Buffered Event]
    Buffer -->|No| Drop[Drop Event]

    Drop --> Counter[url_analytics_events_dropped_total]

    Queue --> Batch{Batch Full or Timer Fires?}

    Batch -->|No| Queue
    Batch -->|Yes| Flush[Flush Batch]

    Flush --> DB[(PostgreSQL url_analytics)]

    DB --> Success{Write Successful?}

    Success -->|Yes| Done[Batch Complete]
    Success -->|No| Retry[Retain Batch for Retry]

    Retry --> Flush